erated by OmniRogue Inc. ("OmniRogue," "Company," "we," "us," or "our").</p><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mb-2">Business Address</h3><div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 border border-primary/20 mb-4"><p>OmniRogue Inc.</p><p>400 N Tampa St Ste 1550 #767523</p><p>Tampa, FL 33602-4719</p><p>United States</p></div><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mb-2">Customer Support</h3><p class="mb-2"><strong>Email:</strong> <a class="text-primary hover:text-primary-glow" href="mailto:support@omnirogue.com">support@omnirogue.com</a></p><p class="mb-2"><strong>Phone:</strong> <!-- -->1-888-777-4675</p><p><strong>Billing and Account Management:</strong> <a class="text-primary hover:text-primary-glow" href="<?= $__checkout; ?>">/lander11__flash-sale__omni/checkout.html class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4"&gt;2. Eligibility and Age Requirements<p>You must be at least 18 years old, or the age of legal majority in your jurisdiction, to create an account, purchase a subscription, or use the Services. By using the Services, you represent and warrant that you meet this age requirement and have the legal capacity to enter into a binding contract with OmniRogue.</p></a></p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">3. Customer Support Response Time</h2><p>For billing, cancellation, access, or technical support, contact<!-- --> <a class="text-primary hover:text-primary-glow" href="mailto:support@omnirogue.com">support@omnirogue.com</a>. We aim to respond to support requests within 1–3 business days. For urgent billing issues, please include the email address used at purchase, the charge date, the amount charged, and the billing descriptor shown on your statement.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">4. Description of Services</h2><p class="mb-4">OmniRogue is a software-as-a-service platform that provides consumers, businesses, agencies, and enterprise customers with access to AI-powered tools, including AI agents, chatbots, workflow automation, document processing, content generation, image and video generation where available, and productivity tools.</p><p class="mb-4">Customers may purchase software subscriptions, platform access, digital credits, lifetime access packages, usage-based AI services, onboarding, implementation services, enterprise licenses, white-label licenses, or related digital tools.</p><p>All Services are delivered digitally unless explicitly stated otherwise. No physical goods are shipped.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">5. Digital Delivery Policy</h2><p class="mb-4">OmniRogue products and services are delivered digitally. After successful payment, customers typically receive access through an OmniRogue account, login credentials, onboarding instructions, email delivery, account dashboard, or other digital access method.</p><p class="mb-4">If you do not receive access within 24 hours after successful payment, contact us at<!-- --> <a class="text-primary hover:text-primary-glow" href="mailto:support@omnirogue.com">support@omnirogue.com</a>.</p><p>Because the Services are digital, there are no physical shipping fees, physical delivery timelines, or physical returns.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">6. No Shipping or Physical Returns</h2><p>OmniRogue provides digital software services only. No physical products are shipped, and no physical returns are accepted.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">7. Merchant of Record, Seller of Record, Connected Accounts, and Billing Relationship</h2><p class="mb-4">For purchases made directly from OmniRogue, OmniRogue Inc. is the merchant of record unless the checkout page states otherwise.</p><p class="mb-4">For purchases made through a white-label partner, reseller, connected business, enterprise customer, agency, affiliate, or third-party brand using Omni