ailto:support@omnirogue.com">support@omnirogue.com</a> <!-- -->before initiating a bank dispute so we can help identify or resolve the transaction.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">9. Plans, Credits, Pricing, and Purchases</h2><p class="mb-4">OmniRogue may offer monthly subscriptions, lifetime access packages, credit packages, enterprise subscriptions, white-label licenses, one-time purchases, usage-based services, and other digital products as displayed at checkout.</p><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mb-2">Consumer plans may include:</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1"><li>Creator — includes 1,000 monthly credits</li><li>Studio — includes 2,250 monthly credits</li><li>Scale — includes 3,500 monthly credits</li><li>Lifetime Access — includes 5,000 credits and does not require a monthly subscription fee</li></ul><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-foreground mb-2">Monthly subscription pricing may include:</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1"><li>$14.99 USD per month</li><li>$29.99 USD per month</li><li>$49.99 USD per month</li></ul><p class="mb-4">OmniRogue may also offer enterprise or white-label licenses, including plans starting at $499 USD per month, or other pricing as displayed at checkout or agreed in writing.</p><p class="mb-4">The price displayed and confirmed at checkout applies to your purchase. Prices, packages, features, credit amounts, and plan names may change from time to time. Pricing changes do not affect a purchase already completed unless you modify, upgrade, downgrade, renew, or repurchase a plan.</p><p>If we increase the price of your active, recurring subscription, we will provide you with advance notice before the new price takes effect, giving you the opportunity to cancel before you are charged the higher amount.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">10. Credits and Usage-Based Services</h2><p class="mb-4">Some OmniRogue plans